{"games":[{"id":5915341487,"name":"Pancake's Wall Hop Difficulty Chart","desc":"Welcome to Pancakes Wallhop Difficulty chart!\n\n[Update 1.21!] Chat Features Update!\n- Chat has been updated to include translation with roblox supported languages\n- New overhead chat name and tags, with coloured bubbles\n\n📝Check out the entire update log here: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/1380845\n\nShutdown = UPDATE/BUG FIX\n\nWallhopping is a glitch in Roblox that this game takes advantage of, to create an obby with increasing difficulty as you progress! If you do not know how to wallhop, there are many YouTube videos with great explanations!\n\n📈 Your progress saves, so you can take a break and come back later!\n\n⭐Current stages: 93!\n\n⚠️ All stages have been tested and are possible!\n\n💀 Press R to reset!\n\n🎁 Join the community server for giveaways! \n\n👉Join our group to get notified about game updates! https://www.roblox.com/groups/5728104/CanPan-Studios#!/about","path":"/game/5915341487-pancake-s-wall-hop-difficulty-chart","slug":"5915341487-pancake-s-wall-hop-difficulty-chart","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4b18d6d68f35c342440700e1efdcfa4cd94f2dd81d64a3275364c31fc805b601.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-78491e7c27bd1d88b51f87f161a21d3c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":99137518,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-10-23T09:41:35.291Z","creator":{"name":"CanPan Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":3144588566,"name":"The Lost Land [Old Version]","desc":"⚠️ This version of The Lost Land has been discontinued.\n🔵 Move to the new The Lost Land [Remastered]: https://www.roblox.com/games/17715563868/The-Lost-Land-Remastered\n\n🏝️Survive on a hidden island full of dangers, obbies, and mysteries. Build your base 🏠, farm your food 🍉, tame exotic animals 🦖, survive disasters 🔥, unlock exclusive items ✨, and explore the secrets of the island.\n\n🌟Level up to unlock new areas, fight bosses, and get the best ore. How long can you survive on this island?\n\n⚔️The island is full of challenges, but with the right mindset and skills, you can overcome them all.\n\n🌎 Join the Group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/6419285","path":"/game/3144588566-the-lost-land","slug":"3144588566-the-lost-land","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0f49449b8ff116ea064d66b8825dfb0edbf0b2f2557acd63741f47c0979e80cf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-74b2008644e092dc4220634bd3dffb0c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":58640691,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-07T21:30:17.682Z","creator":{"name":"focasds","type":"User"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7279999673,"name":"Dragon Blade Open World RPG [BETA]","desc":"Explore sunny trails and moonlit wilds.\n\nBuild your home, battle monsters, and search every habitat for rare mounts to discover and ride.\n\nAdopt horses, dragons, wolves, big cats, unicorns, pegasi, wyverns, pets, and more.\n\nEXPLORE 🌎 BUILD 🛠️ FIGHT 🗡️ RIDE 🐲 ADOPT 🐺\n\n[For bug reports and tech support, use community links below]\n","path":"/game/7279999673-dragon-blade-open-world-rpg","slug":"7279999673-dragon-blade-open-world-rpg","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b0f5154f695d9744c18389f0b1be9c6311b08281b50194c21086f18be3cb1faf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c9323016f128c0d68e462306e0e97497/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":48814342,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-02-24T10:25:19.054Z","creator":{"name":"Black Dog Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":6}},{"id":5715080538,"name":"💥Red vs Blue Gun Battle!💥","desc":"","path":"/game/5715080538-red-vs-blue-gun-battle","slug":"5715080538-red-vs-blue-gun-battle","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e374f4e17930d744ea61a9f812d6e474bd3c5b278802dc042d13430e43017f5c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9e952986b33b70f381090d930